---
import StudioLayout from '../../layouts/StudioLayout.astro';
import { studioView as s } from '../../data/studio';
const room = s.campaignRoom;
---
<StudioLayout title="发布 · 原力 Studio" eyebrow="PUBLICATION GATE">
  <Fragment slot="heading"><h1>发布只是进入世界，<br/>不是生产完成。</h1></Fragment>
  <section class="studio-section"><div class="container studio-grid three">
    <article class="studio-card"><p class="eyebrow">Evidence Boundary</p><h2>最小包已就绪，人审未完成</h2><p>{room?.evidence.status ?? s.campaign.productionState}；Human Review：{room?.evidence.humanReview ?? 'NOT_RUN'}。</p><span class="studio-chip warn">C03 · HYPOTHESIS</span></article>
    <article class="studio-card"><p class="eyebrow">Published</p><h2>公开产物</h2><p>Hook / Mechanism / Action 已有 Output，但“存在”不等于用户已经 Used。</p><span class="studio-chip">MATURITY · {s.campaign.maturity}</span></article>
    <article class="studio-card"><p class="eyebrow">Distribution</p><h2>渠道不是Outcome</h2><p>Public route：{room?.distribution.publicPageStatus ?? s.campaign.publicPageStatus}；Runtime：{room?.distribution.runtimeState ?? s.campaign.productionState}。</p><span class={`studio-chip ${room?.distribution.conflictState === 'CONFLICT' ? 'warn' : ''}`}>{room?.distribution.conflictState ?? s.deliveryStatus}</span></article>
  </div></section>
  <section class="studio-section"><div class="container studio-card"><h2>进入正确系统</h2><p><a class="studio-link" href={room?.distribution.runtimeRef ?? s.sources.find(x=>x.key==='content')?.sourceRef}>Campaign runtime →</a> · <a class="studio-link" href={room?.distribution.workbenchRef ?? 'https://os-zk.84000.art/content-engine-workbench/index.html#orchestration/overview'}>Workbench verified overview →</a></p><p>发布信号只回答“进入世界了没有”，不能替代 10 人 Action 与 Day7 Outcome。</p></div></section>
</StudioLayout>
